{"2813980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons & Dimensions", "steam_appid": 2813980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RELIVE THE DIFFERENT ERAS OF THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a05a205e8f5c1db3dc36a153ba02cd76.poster.avif?t=1786910504\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a05a205e8f5c1db3dc36a153ba02cd76.webm?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a05a205e8f5c1db3dc36a153ba02cd76.mp4?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the lives of those who shaped Dremor. One map may cast you as a Green Knight in 1443 defending Gremdol, while the next takes you deep into the caves of Sordda to see the world through the eyes of a Goblin scout. You’ll inhabit the key characters of the world's most defining historical events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">IMMERSIVE AND FREE EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/667fd95c3edbe20b6379f4ad15fc29e4.poster.avif?t=1786910504\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/667fd95c3edbe20b6379f4ad15fc29e4.webm?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/667fd95c3edbe20b6379f4ad15fc29e4.mp4?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> No mini-maps or quest markers. Use your eyes and ears to navigate. Follow the smoke of a campfire, the rushing of a river, or the mumbles of the people inhabiting Dremor to find your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FIND THE CHRONICLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/70d8bdb962d78c61a3df5bae805d82d4.poster.avif?t=1786910504\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/70d8bdb962d78c61a3df5bae805d82d4.webm?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/70d8bdb962d78c61a3df5bae805d82d4.mp4?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Progression is gated by knowledge. Only by finding the hidden lore of a map can you piece together the full story and complete the era. Gather all the chronicles of the maps to close the chapter for good.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RELIVE THE DIFFERENT ERAS OF THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a05a205e8f5c1db3dc36a153ba02cd76.poster.avif?t=1786910504\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/a05a205e8f5c1db3dc36a153ba02cd76.webm?t=1786910504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite